BST:(Binary Search Tree)
A binary search tree is a special type of binary tree that maintains
its elements in a sorted order.
It is a non-linear and hierarchical data structure.

For every node in the BST:
i)All nodes in its left sub-tree have values less than the node's
value.
ii)All nodes in its right sub-tree have values greater than the node's
value.


