Priority Queue: A priority queue is a special type of queue where
elements are processed based on their priority rather than the 
order in which they were inserted.


Implemented using heap data structure

Defaullt -> Min heap
Custom comparator ->Max heap or custom ordering

Java provides class PriorityQueue

import java.util.PriorityQueue

Min Priority Queue: In this queue elements with lower values 
have higher priorities.

Max priority Queue: In this queue elements with higher values 
have higher priorities.


